Package: getdp
Version: 4.0.0
Architecture: riscv64
Maintainer: Gurleen Kansray <your@email.com>
Description: GetDP finite element solver — riscv64 cross-compiled
 GetDP is a free finite element solver using mixed elements to discretize
 de Rham-type complexes in one, two and three dimensions.
 Cross-compiled for riscv64 as part of LFX RISC-V HPC porting effort.
Depends: libc6
